nce and validity of a reset token but fails to verify if the token is bound to the specific user being modified.\n\n### HIGH: Session Fixation\nThe application fails to rotate the session token upon a change in authentication status (privilege escalation).</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tab-content\" data-tab=\"Hide\">\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div class=\" response-message\">\n<div class=\"tabs-container\" id=\"5b1c76cf-b4d7-4cc0-b67e-564ddb5bf01e\">\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n<button class=\"tab-button active\" data-for-tab=\"HTML\">HTML</button>\n<button class=\"tab-button\" data-for-tab=\"Markdown\">Markdown</button>\n<button class=\"tab-button\" data-for-tab=\"Hide\">Hide</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tab-content active\" data-tab=\"HTML\">\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> ✅ Complete</p>\n<p><strong>Vulnerabilities Found:</strong> 5</p>\n<p><strong>Analysis Time:</strong> 31.358s</p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tab-content\" data-tab=\"Markdown\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-markdown\">---\n\n**Status:** ✅ Complete\n\n**Vulnerabilities Found:** 5\n\n**Analysis Time:** 31.358s\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tab-content\" data-tab=\"Hide\">\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div><div class=\" completion-message response-message\"></div></div>"